# Generated: cargo doc writes HTML, CSS and JavaScript in here.
target/

# npm owns this file and rewrites it; formatting it would create churn on every install.
package-lock.json

# spec-kit owns these; it rewrites them on every `specify update` and on every
# `specify integration install`, and they are not ours to reformat.
.claude/skills/speckit-*/
.opencode/
.specify/*

# Except the three templates this repository writes itself: their stock contents were replaced
# outright, so the reason above stops reaching them. Written as four lines rather than three
# negations because gitignore syntax cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded —
# each directory on the way down has to be re-included first, and `!.specify/templates/spec-*.md`
# under a plain `.specify/` is silently inert. Verified by breaking one on purpose.
!.specify/templates/
.specify/templates/*
!.specify/templates/spec-template.md
!.specify/templates/plan-template.md
!.specify/templates/decisions-template.md
